{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/run_a_shop_quicker_final.gif?t=1744155443\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/defend.gif?t=1744155443\" />Congratulations on buying your very first store! However, prepare to quickly learn that this is not your average pizza franchise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You run a pizza shop by day, doing the typical job simulator actives and then as night falls you experience the tower defense aspect of Slice &amp; Dice, fighting off hordes of angry customers, bosses &amp; disgruntled members of a rival pizza shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trying to keep your business afloat is the least of your problems when enemies grow in numbers each night and are trying to destroy your beloved Pizzaria.<br> <br> <br><u>Key Features <br> </u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/map.gif?t=1744155443\" /><u> </u>  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Multi-Leveled Puzzles and Challenges</strong>: Engaging gameplay loops that include cooking simulations, tower defense strategies, competitive multiplayer modes, and team-based challenges. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/teams.gif?t=1744155443\" />\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Multiplayer Co-op</strong>: Challenge your friendships by playing against them or play on the same side and upgrade your shop to the best of your crews abilities (Up to 8 players)<br> <br>  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>OST</strong>: Original Soundtrack and sound effects crafted by Brightside Movement, enhancing the culinary adventure.  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Immersive Graphics</strong>: A unique stylized environment that helps create a vibrant and delicious world where players can truly experience the art of pizza making and tomatoe sauce spilling\u00a0<br><br><u>Lore:</u><br>\u25a0 Mario Meatballs has always yearned to create the ultimate pizzeria, and now that he's found a spot within his budget, his dream has become a reality. But he will soon find out that there's a reason why the real estate was such a steal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this thrilling pizza-making simulation with a dash of tower defense, you'll step into Mario's shoes and manage every aspect of running a brick-and-mortar shop by day then at night fend off hordes of crazed lunatics and other totally normal things for a small business owner.\u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398560?t=1744155443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744155443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/482fa23fbbb48727d42d975d5b4c17e89fd9352d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744155443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/482fa23fbbb48727d42d975d5b4c17e89fd9352d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744155443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3516390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/run_a_shop_quicker_final.gif?t=1744155443\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/defend.gif?t=1744155443\" />Congratulations on buying your very first store! However, prepare to quickly learn that this is not your average pizza franchise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You run a pizza shop by day, doing the typical job simulator actives and then as night falls you experience the tower defense aspect of Slice &amp; Dice, fighting off hordes of angry customers, bosses &amp; disgruntled members of a rival pizza shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trying to keep your business afloat is the least of your problems when enemies grow in numbers each night and are trying to destroy your beloved Pizzaria.<br> <br> <br><u>Key Features <br> </u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/map.gif?t=1744155443\" /><u> </u>  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Multi-Leveled Puzzles and Challenges</strong>: Engaging gameplay loops that include cooking simulations, tower defense strategies, competitive multiplayer modes, and team-based challenges. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/teams.gif?t=1744155443\" />\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Multiplayer Co-op</strong>: Challenge your friendships by playing against them or play on the same side and upgrade your shop to the best of your crews abilities (Up to 8 players)<br> <br>  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>OST</strong>: Original Soundtrack and sound effects crafted by Brightside Movement, enhancing the culinary adventure.  <br>\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Immersive Graphics</strong>: A unique stylized environment that helps create a vibrant and delicious world where players can truly experience the art of pizza making and tomatoe sauce spilling\u00a0<br><br><u>Lore:</u><br>\u25a0 Mario Meatballs has always yearned to create the ultimate pizzeria, and now that he's found a spot within his budget, his dream has become a reality. But he will soon find out that there's a reason why the real estate was such a steal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this thrilling pizza-making simulation with a dash of tower defense, you'll step into Mario's shoes and manage every aspect of running a brick-and-mortar shop by day then at night fend off hordes of crazed lunatics and other totally normal things for a small business owner.\u00a0\u00a0</p>","developers":["Soundbyte Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/header.jpg?t=1744155443","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108113,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108113/movie480.mp4?t=1740699351","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108113/movie_max.mp4?t=1740699351"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108113/6999d5ea8a1d1c70882df95b936dfd87e40c34c5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740699351","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108113/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740699351","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108113/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740699351"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257085144,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085144/movie480.mp4?t=1735382209","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085144/movie_max.mp4?t=1735382209"},"name":"Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257085144/0f4a5f11c7708ab3d7648688e7b6188b71130550/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1735382209","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257085144/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1735382209","max":